2022 is a continuation-of-consolidation case for political freedom: the strongest signals are election-law manipulation, weak parliamentary and judicial checks, media capture, local-trustee rule, and targeted prosecutions of opposition and journalists. I reused the prior constitutional and crackdown evidence where it genuinely fit, and added a small set of higher-value 2022 institutional and media sources.

